 3.18

Signed-off-by: Kyle Steere <kyle.steere@chainguard.dev>
---
 build.xml | 8 ++++----
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/build.xml b/build.xml
index ca84184c83..f6c7c83c34 100644
--- a/build.xml
+++ b/build.xml
@@ -577,7 +577,7 @@
